# CSS Scroll Motion

scroll listener / IntersectionObserver / JS carousel を作る前に、Chrome 先行の CSS
で実装できるか検討する。Scroll-driven animations、scroll-state queries、
CSS-only carousel、reading-flow を積極採用する。

## Scroll-driven animations

- 読了バー: `animation-timeline: scroll(root block)`
- reveal: `animation-timeline: view()` + `animation-range`
- scrollytelling: `view-timeline-name` を section に付け、子要素の `animation-timeline` で参照
- 複雑な scroll container では `scroll-timeline-name` / `scroll-timeline-axis` で timeline を命名
- `prefers-reduced-motion` で無効化または簡略化する

```css
.readingProgress {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0 0 auto;
  z-index: 100;
  block-size: 3px;
  transform-origin: left;
  background: var(--color-action-bg);
  animation: reading-progress linear both;
  animation-timeline: scroll(root block);
}

@keyframes reading-progress {
  from { scale: 0 1; }
  to { scale: 1 1; }
}
```

```css
.reveal {
  opacity: 0;
  translate: 0 2rem;
  animation: reveal-on-view linear both;
  animation-timeline: view(block);
  animation-range: entry 10% cover 35%;
}

@keyframes reveal-on-view {
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    translate: 0 0;
  }
}
```

```css
.storySection {
  view-timeline-name: --story;
  view-timeline-axis: block;
}

.storyImage {
  animation: story-parallax linear both;
  animation-timeline: --story;
  animation-range: entry 0% exit 100%;
}

@keyframes story-parallax {
  from { transform: translateY(8cqb) scale(1.04); }
  to { transform: translateY(-8cqb) scale(1.04); }
}
```

```css
.horizontalScroller {
  overflow-x: auto;
  scroll-snap-type: inline mandatory;
  scroll-timeline-name: --horizontal-progress;
  scroll-timeline-axis: inline;
}

.horizontalProgress {
  block-size: 2px;
  transform-origin: left;
  background: var(--color-action-bg);
  animation: horizontal-progress linear both;
  animation-timeline: --horizontal-progress;
}

@keyframes horizontal-progress {
  from { scale: 0 1; }
  to { scale: 1 1; }
}
```

## Scroll-state queries

- sticky header shrink: `container-type: scroll-state` + `@container scroll-state(stuck: top)`
- snap 中カード強調: `@container scroll-state(snapped: inline)`
- scroll hint: `@container scroll-state(scrollable: inline)`

```css
.siteHeader {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 50;
  container-type: scroll-state;
}

.siteHeader__inner {
  padding-block: 1rem;
  background: Canvas;
  transition: padding-block 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, background 0.2s;
}

@container scroll-state(stuck: top) {
  .siteHeader__inner {
    padding-block: 0.5rem;
    background: color-mix(in oklab, Canvas 86%, transparent);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 color-mix(in oklab, CanvasText 16%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }
}
```

```css
.rail {
  overflow-x: auto;
  scroll-snap-type: inline mandatory;
  container-type: scroll-state;
}

.snapCard {
  scroll-snap-align: center;
  container-type: scroll-state;
}

.snapCard__inner {
  scale: 0.94;
  opacity: 0.72;
  transition: scale 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
}

@container scroll-state(snapped: inline) {
  .snapCard__inner {
    scale: 1;
    opacity: 1;
  }
}

.railHint {
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.2s;
}

@container scroll-state(scrollable: inline) {
  .railHint {
    opacity: 1;
  }
}
```

## CSS-only carousel

`scroll-snap-type` を基盤にし、対応環境では `::scroll-button()` /
`::scroll-marker()` / `::scroll-marker-group` を使う。Anchor Positioning と組み合わせる。

```css
.carousel {
  anchor-name: --carousel;
  display: grid;
  grid-auto-flow: column;
  grid-auto-columns: minmax(18rem, 80cqi);
  gap: 1rem;
  overflow-x: auto;
  overscroll-behavior-inline: contain;
  scroll-snap-type: inline mandatory;
  scroll-marker-group: after;
  scrollbar-gutter: stable both-edges;
}

.carousel__item {
  scroll-snap-align: center;
}

.carousel::scroll-button(inline-start),
.carousel::scroll-button(inline-end) {
  position: absolute;
  position-anchor: --carousel;
  align-self: anchor-center;
  inline-size: 2.5rem;
  block-size: 2.5rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, CanvasText 24%, transparent);
  background: Canvas;
  color: CanvasText;
}

.carousel::scroll-button(inline-start) {
  content: "‹";
  inset-inline-start: calc(anchor(left) + 0.5rem);
}

.carousel::scroll-button(inline-end) {
  content: "›";
  inset-inline-end: calc(100% - anchor(right) + 0.5rem);
}

.carousel::scroll-marker-group {
  position: absolute;
  position-anchor: --carousel;
  justify-self: anchor-center;
  inset-block-start: calc(anchor(bottom) + 0.75rem);
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}

.carousel__item::scroll-marker {
  content: "";
  inline-size: 0.5rem;
  block-size: 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: color-mix(in oklab, CanvasText 28%, transparent);
}

.carousel__item::scroll-marker:target-current {
  background: var(--color-action-bg);
}
```

## Reading order / focus order

Grid / Flex の visual order と DOM order がずれる場合は HTML の順序修正を優先。
難しい場合のみ `reading-flow` / `reading-order` で補正する。

```css
.dashboardGrid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
  reading-flow: grid-rows;
}

.dashboardGrid__primaryAction {
  reading-order: -1;
}

.toolbar {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row-reverse;
  reading-flow: flex-visual;
}
```

## Do not

- scroll listener で毎フレーム style を更新する
- 本文テキストに大きな parallax をかける
- `prefers-reduced-motion` なしで scroll animation を導入する
- carousel のために独自 focus management を作り込む
